@startuml 10-static-checks
!pragma layout smetana
' 静态检查的责任目录；数据流与诊断所有权见 09-diagnostics。
' 来源：GameProc/parse_checks.h, load_passes.h, era_parse_table.h

title GameProc：静态检查目录

rectangle "parsecheck::resolveStaticTargets" as Targets
rectangle "parsecheck::checkStructures" as Structures
rectangle "parsecheck::checkStaticValues" as Values
rectangle "loadpass::finalizeBindings" as Bindings
rectangle "ParseDiagnostics::replaceOrigin" as Sink

Targets --> Sink : Pass4 / target diagnostics
Structures --> Sink : Pass5 / structure diagnostics
Values --> Sink : Pass6 / value diagnostics
Bindings --> Sink : Pass2 / binding diagnostics

note bottom of Targets
  CALL / GOTO / TRY* targets, undefined function warnings,
  and jump destinations are checked from the finalized table.
end note

note bottom of Structures
  Pairing and structural checks read the existing markings;
  they do not rebuild the script AST.
end note

note bottom of Values
  Constant bounds, dimensions, and static expression facts.
  A missing runtime function such as @GAMEOVER remains a real
  content diagnostic; this diagram does not invent a fallback function.
end note
@enduml
